        "2": {
          "content": "## Change Log\n* v 3.8: Fix KPM usage calculation\n* v 3.7: Fix for Traces OTel ingest\n* v 3.6: Include Metrics ingest, fix filter drop down\n* v 3.5: Included RUM total usage (no Cost Allocation support – only \"unassigned\")\n* v 3.4: Fixed calculation error for Retain capabilities, included units to rate card prices for easier configuration\n* v 3.3: Adjusted for Log Retain/RwiQ \u0026 Fixed Trace Ingest billed usage\n* v 3.2: Fixed some overlooked lookup table references\n* v 3.1: Dedup events\n* v 3.0: Branched a version w/o lookup tables to ensure no related costs",
